## Project Overview

This is a custom website built with Aptuitiv's custom build tools and Cacao CSS framework.

## Tech Stack

- **CSS Framework**: Cacao CSS (utility class library) - <https://github.com/aptuitiv/cacao>
- **Build Tools**: Aptuitiv Build Tools - <https://github.com/aptuitiv/website-build-tools>
- **Templating**: Twig v3
- **JavaScript**: Modern vanilla JavaScript
- **Browser Support**: Latest 2 versions of Safari, Chrome, Firefox, and Edge,

## File Structure

- `dist/` - Built/compiled files. Do not edit these.
- `src/` - Source files
- `src/css/` - CSS source files
- `src/js/` - JavaScript source files
- `src/images/` - Source image assets
- `src/icons/` - Source SVG icons
- `src/templates/` - Twig templates
